{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 14451569311734634043,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Date/Time Parsing and Formatting",
      "source_hash": 391417587794714600,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "날짜/시간 파싱과 포매팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603676Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 8765787825643136457,
      "translation": "개요",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Python 2.3 added a number of simple date and time types in the ``datetime`` module.",
      "source_hash": 4862431039854473847,
      "context_hash": 13877119817278496996,
      "translation": "Python 2.3은 ``datetime`` 모듈에 여러 간단한 날짜 및 시간 타입을 추가했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603679Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "There's no support for parsing strings in various formats and returning a corresponding instance of one of the types.",
      "source_hash": 10206945893542828760,
      "context_hash": 2946065258581323117,
      "translation": "다양한 형식의 문자열을 파싱하여 해당 타입 중 하나의 인스턴스를 반환하는 기능은 지원되지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603680Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "This PEP proposes adding a family of predefined parsing function for several commonly used date and time formats, and a facility for generic parsing.",
      "source_hash": 18059442395119325557,
      "context_hash": 13979921354284823876,
      "translation": "이 PEP는 흔히 사용되는 여러 날짜 및 시간 형식에 대해 미리 정의된 파싱 함수 모음과, 범용 파싱을 위한 기능을 추가할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The types provided by the ``datetime`` module all have ``.isoformat()`` and ``.ctime()`` methods that return string representations of a time, and the ``.strftime()`` method can be used to construct new formats.",
      "source_hash": 1179630221169464246,
      "context_hash": 10271097100619102284,
      "translation": "``datetime`` 모듈이 제공하는 타입들은 모두 시간의 문자열 표현을 반환하는 ``.isoformat()``\\ 과 ``.ctime()`` 메서드를 가지고 있으며, ``.strftime()`` 메서드를 사용하여 새로운 형식을 구성할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603681Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "There are a number of additional commonly-used formats that would be useful to have as part of the standard library; this PEP also suggests how to add them.",
      "source_hash": 15116908200652767854,
      "context_hash": 9365408101226036234,
      "translation": "표준 라이브러리의 일부로 포함되면 유용할 흔히 사용되는 형식이 여러 가지 더 있습니다; 이 PEP는 이를 추가하는 방법도 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "standard library": "표준 라이브러리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603682Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Input Formats",
      "source_hash": 8005968488512095765,
      "context_hash": 11018810809780221674,
      "translation": "입력 형식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603683Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Useful formats to support include:",
      "source_hash": 9515633511641024484,
      "context_hash": 18293903904893891911,
      "translation": "지원하면 유용한 형식은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "`ISO8601`_",
      "source_hash": 8913321980629471619,
      "context_hash": 3310568650702059437,
      "translation": "`ISO8601`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "ARPA/:rfc:`2822`",
      "source_hash": 8001211536135063583,
      "context_hash": 5931257455124225429,
      "translation": "ARPA/:rfc:`2822`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "`ctime`_",
      "source_hash": 5888529743477205874,
      "context_hash": 13261752046560471707,
      "translation": "`ctime`_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603684Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Formats commonly written by humans such as the American \"MM/DD/YYYY\", the European \"YYYY/MM/DD\", and variants such as \"DD-Month-YYYY\".",
      "source_hash": 11279419765378852969,
      "context_hash": 3744527115776962485,
      "translation": "\"MM/DD/YYYY\"와 같은 미국식, \"YYYY/MM/DD\"와 같은 유럽식, 그리고 \"DD-Month-YYYY\"와 같은 변형 등, 사람들이 흔히 작성하는 형식.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603685Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "CVS-style or tar-style dates (\"tomorrow\", \"12 hours ago\", etc.)",
      "source_hash": 7119343192446404510,
      "context_hash": 9361481543499541371,
      "translation": "CVS 스타일 또는 tar 스타일 날짜(\"tomorrow\", \"12 hours ago\" 등)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603685Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "XXX The Perl `ParseDate.pm`_ module supports many different input formats, both absolute and relative.",
      "source_hash": 5743272915326494569,
      "context_hash": 12036242883564615509,
      "translation": "XXX Perl의 `ParseDate.pm`_ 모듈은 절대적 및 상대적 형식을 포함하여 다양한 입력 형식을 지원합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:1",
      "source": "Should we try to support them all?",
      "source_hash": 1664150157373849538,
      "context_hash": 5828206476497846945,
      "translation": "이들을 모두 지원하도록 시도해야 합니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:33:53.603686Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Options:",
      "source_hash": 13198859995526964297,
      "context_hash": 14640871157242572076,
      "translation": "옵션:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088786Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Add functions to the ``datetime`` module",
      "source_hash": 7831320857706659232,
      "context_hash": 551589804002264379,
      "translation": "``datetime`` 모듈에 함수를 추가합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088790Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Add class methods to the various types.",
      "source_hash": 4622409764522272289,
      "context_hash": 6883773762680598544,
      "translation": "여러 타입에 클래스 메서드를 추가합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088790Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:1",
      "source": "There are already various class methods such as ``.now()``, so this would be pretty natural.",
      "source_hash": 14973388723524158857,
      "context_hash": 15491607782095194298,
      "translation": "``.now()``\\ 와 같은 다양한 클래스 메서드가 이미 있으므로, 이는 상당히 자연스러울 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088791Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "Add a separate module (possible names: date, date_parse, parse_date) or subpackage (possible names: datetime.parser) containing parsing functions",
      "source_hash": 4940193136134158289,
      "context_hash": 12573673130454501762,
      "translation": "파싱 함수를 담은 별도의 모듈(가능한 이름: date, date_parse, parse_date)이나 서브패키지(가능한 이름: datetime.parser)를 추가합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088791Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:15/seg:0",
      "source": "Unresolved questions:",
      "source_hash": 8782899033351584875,
      "context_hash": 11526256593733787986,
      "translation": "미해결 질문:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088792Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:16/seg:0",
      "source": "Naming convention to use.",
      "source_hash": 9249877891752704964,
      "context_hash": 17157741386455021030,
      "translation": "사용할 명명 규칙.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088792Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:0",
      "source": "What exception to raise on errors?",
      "source_hash": 5734601275093871837,
      "context_hash": 2469565129262553885,
      "translation": "오류 발생 시 어떤 예외를 발생시켜야 할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088792Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:17/seg:1",
      "source": "ValueError, or a specialized exception?",
      "source_hash": 13972149839158375844,
      "context_hash": 8301591341885837657,
      "translation": "ValueError일까요, 아니면 특수화된 예외일까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088792Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:18/seg:0",
      "source": "Should you know what type you're expecting, or should the parsing figure it out?  (e.g. ``parse_iso8601(\"yyyy-mm-dd\")`` returns a ``date`` instance, but parsing \"yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm:ss\" returns a ``datetime``.)  Should there be an option to signal an error if a time is provided where none is expected, or if no time is provided?",
      "source_hash": 16316596879681512246,
      "context_hash": 16538370190448782559,
      "translation": "예상되는 타입을 미리 알아야 할까요, 아니면 파싱이 이를 알아내야 할까요? (예를 들어, ``parse_iso8601(\"yyyy-mm-dd\")``\\ 는 ``date`` 인스턴스를 반환하지만, \"yyyy-mm-ddThh:mm:ss\"를 파싱하면 ``datetime``\\ 을 반환합니다.) 시간이 예상되지 않는데 제공된 경우, 혹은 시간이 제공되지 않은 경우 오류를 알리는 옵션이 있어야 할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088793Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:0",
      "source": "Anything special required for I18N?",
      "source_hash": 13726938229144777465,
      "context_hash": 2594441381893126630,
      "translation": "국제화(I18N)에 필요한 특별한 사항이 있을까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088793Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:19/seg:1",
      "source": "For time zones?",
      "source_hash": 7506514542034318852,
      "context_hash": 16227707158215718126,
      "translation": "시간대의 경우는 어떨까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088793Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Generic Input Parsing",
      "source_hash": 3077961436079595563,
      "context_hash": 15474468539167846730,
      "translation": "범용 입력 파싱",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088793Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Is a strptime() implementation that returns ``datetime`` types sufficient?",
      "source_hash": 16987048992505360868,
      "context_hash": 120961259415365414,
      "translation": "``datetime`` 타입을 반환하는 strptime() 구현으로 충분할까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088794Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "XXX if yes, describe strptime here.",
      "source_hash": 2802322831242952838,
      "context_hash": 1157466428010586730,
      "translation": "XXX 그렇다면, 여기에 strptime을 설명하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088794Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Can the existing pure-Python implementation be easily retargeted?",
      "source_hash": 13072408983675874278,
      "context_hash": 13728058919694745184,
      "translation": "기존의 순수 파이썬 구현을 쉽게 재대상화할 수 있을까요?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:26:42.088794Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Output Formats",
      "source_hash": 14297875077621524527,
      "context_hash": 14921792917008891347,
      "translation": "출력 형식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Not all input formats need to be supported as output formats, because it's pretty trivial to get the ``strftime()`` argument right for simple things such as YYYY/MM/DD.",
      "source_hash": 9775986076071707609,
      "context_hash": 11164477180670507635,
      "translation": "YYYY/MM/DD와 같은 단순한 형식에서는 ``strftime()`` 인자를 올바르게 지정하는 것이 매우 간단하므로, 모든 입력 형식을 출력 형식으로 지원할 필요는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777132Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Only complicated formats need to be supported; :rfc:`2822` is currently the only one I can think of.",
      "source_hash": 8476069493801871439,
      "context_hash": 11836701666707025538,
      "translation": "복잡한 형식만 지원하면 되며, 현재 제가 떠올릴 수 있는 것은 :rfc:`2822`\\ 뿐입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777132Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Options:",
      "source_hash": 13198859995526964297,
      "context_hash": 17073688807174221493,
      "translation": "옵션:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777132Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Provide predefined format strings, so you could write this",
      "source_hash": 15295096936746062308,
      "context_hash": 9802906121341049005,
      "translation": "미리 정의된 형식 문자열을 제공하여 다음과 같이 작성할 수 있게 합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777133Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Provide new methods on all the objects",
      "source_hash": 7189361996175938665,
      "context_hash": 5916598861103012559,
      "translation": "모든 객체에 새로운 메서드를 제공합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Relevant functionality in other languages includes the `PHP date`_ function (Python implementation by Simon Willison at http://simon.incutio.com/archive/2003/10/07/dateInPython)",
      "source_hash": 2213664028404141022,
      "context_hash": 11492402294839908022,
      "translation": "다른 언어의 관련 기능으로는 `PHP date`_ 함수(Simon Willison이 http://simon.incutio.com/archive/2003/10/07/dateInPython 에서 구현한 파이썬 버전)가 있습니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References",
      "source_hash": 17861670083855418992,
      "context_hash": 11519633374521825154,
      "translation": "참조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:19:55.777134Z",
      "issues": []
